曰：「吾悔不先斬錯，乃先請之，為錯所賣。」至舍，因歐血而死。謚為節侯。子共侯蔑代，三年卒。子侯去病代，三十一年卒。子侯臾代，六歲，坐為九江太守受故官送有罪，國除。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang","source_id":"s-shiji-096-zhang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:p018","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m018-0000","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/096.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》景帝年序起點","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","quote":"孝景元年","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r051-c01","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》原年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","quote":"二","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r052-c01","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》數位西元對照","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","quote":"155","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r052-c00","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》同年死亡記載","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","quote":"立皇子德為河閒王，閼為臨江王，餘為淮陽王，非為汝南王，彭祖為廣川王，發為長沙王。四月中，孝文太后崩。嘉卒。","scope":"received_parallel_event","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r052-c02","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·張丞相列傳》漢初歲首","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷096&oldid=8770206","quote":"以高祖十月始至霸上，因故秦時本以十月為歲首，弗革。","scope":"received_calendar_rule","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"本篇景帝紀年與年表原年欄、死亡敘事相配；西元數字僅取數位編者對照，與受傳原文分列。漢初仍以十月為歲首，死亡月份不明，該年可能落前一西元年末或對照年，保留兩年範圍，不當確定單年。嘉卒與表中太后四月卒分句，不據此替申屠嘉補死亡月份。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}},{"id":"le-shiji101-001","person_id":"yph_dkb_w4w","event_type":"death","status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"source_term":"丞相遂發病死","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao","source_id":"s-shiji-101-yuanchao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p018","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m018-0037","quote_pas